OL,3,ARescue to continue overnight for 'in
OL,4,Adistress' vessel carrying five in the
OL,5,AChannel
OL,6,
OL,7,FRNLI lifeboats from Falmouth and
OL,8,FPlymouth have been joined by a number
OL,9,Fof civilian vessels which are assisting
OL,10,Fthe operation.
